    "bodyText": "SC TO-I\nIssuer: NovaTech Robotics Inc.\nNovaTech Robotics Inc. commenced an issuer tender offer to purchase up to 2,000,000 shares of its common stock at a purchase price of $25.00 per share in cash. The maximum aggregate purchase price is $50 million. The offer will expire at 5:00 p.m. Eastern Time on June 20, 2026, unless extended. Withdrawal rights expire on June 20, 2026. If more than 2,000,000 shares are properly tendered, shares will be purchased on a prorated basis.",
